DATA ATTRIBUTION:

The data analyzed in this project comes from the World Bank Enterprise Survey
(WBES) - Vietnam 2023. The data is publicly available from the World Bank and
may be used for non-commercial analytical purposes. Please cite the source:

  World Bank. (2023). Vietnam Enterprise Survey 2023. Enterprise Surveys.
  Retrieved from https://www.enterprisesurveys.org
